Subject: [PATCH 142/211] LLAMA_MOE_CACHE_BORROW_MIB=N: the cache borrows the
 compute buffer (and with LLAMA_MOE_CACHE_BORROW_RING=1 the upload ring)
 through CUDA VMM pages shared with an arena; slots given up before a graph
 that reaches past LLAMA_MOE_CACHE_BORROW_HEAD_MIB

